<title>CANADA: TecSyn to continue normal course issuer bid.</title>
<headline>TecSyn to continue normal course issuer bid.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>TecSyn International Inc said on Tuesday it planned to continue the normal course issuer bid begun on October 18, 1995, to acquire up to five percent of its outstanding shares in the next year.</p>
<p>TecSyn bought and cancelled 251,254 common shares in the past 12 months. It currently has 53.05 million common shares issued and outstanding.</p>
<p>The continuation is subject to regulatory approval.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
